Third-party code
----------------

`vendor/hdf5-pure/` is a vendored copy of the `hdf5-pure` crate, carrying local
patches; it is MIT licensed and ships its own LICENSE file.

The optional external programs `cd-hit`, `usearch` and `orphos` are GPL licensed.
They are neither bundled nor linked: Domainator downloads them only at the user's request
and runs them as separate processes.
